@startuml

title Fluxo Principal - Atualizacao de Ticket com Notificacao n8n

autoactivate on

actor User
participant "Frontend\n(Ticket Detail)" as FE
participant "Backend API\n/tickets/{id} PATCH" as API
participant "TicketService" as Service
participant "TicketRepository" as Repo
database "SQLite\n(tickets.db)" as DB
participant "N8nClient" as N8nClient
participant "n8n Webhook" as N8nWebhook

User -> FE: Altera status/prioridade e salva
FE -> API: PATCH /tickets/{id}
API -> Service: update_ticket(ticket_id, payload)
Service -> Repo: get_ticket_by_id(ticket_id)
Repo -> DB: SELECT ticket
DB --> Repo: ticket
Repo --> Service: ticket

Service -> Repo: update_ticket(ticket, payload)
Repo -> DB: UPDATE ticket + COMMIT
DB --> Repo: ok
Repo --> Service: updated_ticket

Service -> N8nClient: notify_ticket_updated(id, status)
N8nClient -> N8nWebhook: POST webhook (ticket_id, status)
N8nWebhook --> N8nClient: 2xx/erro
N8nClient --> Service: retorno (log em caso de erro)

Service --> API: updated_ticket
API --> FE: 200 OK + ticket atualizado
FE --> User: Confirma atualizacao

@enduml
